**Author:** <Your Name / Role>

---

## 1. Introduction
This test strategy addresses the validation of Jira API authentication and error handling mechanisms, focusing on scenarios where the API returns a 401 Unauthorized error. The scope is limited to technical validation of authentication and error propagation, as business requirements for issue AD-488 are inaccessible due to Jira API authentication failure.

---

