## 3. Test Scope

### 3.2 Test Scope

#### 3.2.1 In Scope
- Jira API authentication validation
- Error handling for unauthorized access (401)

#### 3.2.2 Out of Scope
- Functional or business requirements for issue AD-488 (not accessible)
- Any features not related to authentication or error handling

