### 4.6 Test Environments
- Staging environment with controlled Jira API access (ability to toggle authentication/authorization states)
- Mock service or proxy to simulate 401 Unauthorized responses from Jira API
- Test data matrix of API credentials (valid, expired, revoked, malformed)

